Event observers now receive `/attachments/new` payloads only when subscribed with the new `"attachments"` event key or with `"*"`; previously every observer received them regardless of `events_keys` ([#5558](https://github.com/stacks-network/stacks-core/issues/5558)). Operators whose observers consume `/attachments/new` without `"*"` must add `"attachments"` to that observer's `events_keys`.
